SUMMARY:Tea & Tarot for the Collective
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nTarot readings are a powerful tool for ta
 pping into the energies that surround us and exploring the depths of our p
 syche.\n\nExperience an energetic vibe check as the cards illuminate pathw
 ays to understanding\, clarity\, and personal growth. We'll dive into the 
 layers of our conscious\, subconscious\, and unconscious beings.\n\nMarian
  will do a reading for the collective group first\, then dive into mini-re
 adings for each individual in attendance.\n\nWe will have local\, organic\
 , hot herbal tea from Appalachian DiviniTEA and water available to sip on 
 during this event.\n\nSuggested Exchange: $10\n\nThis event is hosted by M
 arian Noble of Energetic Experiences. She offers [private tarot readings](
 https://energeticexperiences.co/tarot) in person\, online\, and by phone.
