SUMMARY:Crystal Pyramid Sound Healing
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nRelease and reset with a heart-centered s
 ound bath layered with crystal beds\, a pyramid\, crystal light chakra bal
 ancing and energy healing!\n\nExperience a unique and transformative sound
  bath journey and more! In this deeply nurturing and restorative sound bat
 h\, you will receive the additional healing benefits of lying on a full-le
 ngth cushioned bed of infused amethyst crystals\, with the option of lying
  inside our crystal-filled heart chakra pyramid or under the infused chakr
 a balancing crystal lights. The space is anchored with many crystals\, pla
 nts and a heart-centered energy that is both nurturing and magical. Group 
 size is small so that each person can start their journey by experiencing 
 the cleansing energy of standing inside a Tibetan foot bowl while its bein
 g played. This opens and clears your energy field to receive and drop more
  deeply into the experience.\n\nCome relax\, reset and remember the peace 
 that you are as the soothing waves of many sacred sound instruments wash t
 hrough you. There is nothing you have to do or prepare for\, just come as 
 you are and experience a variety of crystal and Tibetan bowls\, rain stick
 s\, bells\, chimes\, gongs and more while bathing in the healing energy al
 l around you.\n\nSound healing activates the healing theta brain state and
  parasympathetic nervous system\, releasing stress\, quieting the mind and
  dropping into a deep state of well-being. The sound waves are resonant wi
 th the chakras\, energy field and cells to support balance and alignment.\
 n\n***As a special bonus\, each person receives a crystal gift to hold dur
 ing the sound bath and then take home to reconnect with energy of your per
 sonal experience!***\n\n**Additional Information:**\n**RSVP-**\n**https://
 sedonaheartlight.as.me/?appointmentType=97015908**\nor\n**https://www.even
 tbrite.com/e/crystal-pyramid-sound-healing-registration-1997988825361?aff=
 oddtdtcreator**\n\\*space is limited to 5\\*\n\n**Comfort-** You do not ne
 ed to bring anything with you unless you feel to. All of your comfort need
 s- pillows\, blankets\, bolsters\, eye pillows and water will be provided 
 for you. Afterwards you are welcome to relax inside\, outside\, browse the
  metaphysical gift shop and/or ask any questions you may have.\n**Location
 -** HeartLight is located at the end of a one-mile gravel road. It is fine
  for cars\, just take it slow through the shallow creek section. There is 
 a horse trail riding business nearby\, so please be mindful and yield to h
 orses. Please drive slow and give yourself a few extra minutes in travel t
 ime in case you encounter a horse crossing.\n**Parking-** After you pass t
 hrough the open gate\, parking is on the grass to your right. Entrance is 
 through the sliding glass doors on the lower level.\n**Additional Informat
 ion or Questions-** 928-451-5512\nHeartLight Healing Center - https://www.
 sedonaheartlight.com
