SUMMARY:✨Cosmic Quietude: Astrology & Gong Meditation✨
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n🎶✨Cosmic Quietude: Astrology & Gong 
 Meditation✨🎶\n**Sunday September 6th 2:00-3:30 PM at Quietude Sanctua
 ry\, Black Mountain**\nJoin astrologer and sound practitioner **David Heis
 s of Star Sounds** for a nourishing Sunday afternoon designed to help you 
 align with the rhythms of the cosmos while settling deeply into stillness\
 , presence\, and restoration.\nEach gathering begins with a **20-minute As
 trology Transmission**\, exploring the current planetary transits and the 
 deeper themes moving through the collective and our personal lives. Throug
 h an evolutionary and soul-centered lens\, David offers practical and insp
 iring insights to help you consciously navigate the energies of the week a
 head.\nFrom there\, participants will be guided into a **50-minute Gong So
 und Journey**. Surrounded by the resonant tones of planetary gongs\, singi
 ng bowls\, and sacred sound instruments\, you'll be invited into a meditat
 ive state where the thinking mind can soften\, the nervous system can unwi
 nd\, and a deeper connection to Self can emerge.\nWhether you are seeking 
 relaxation\, spiritual insight\, emotional renewal\, or simply a quiet pla
 ce to rest and reconnect\, this weekly experience offers a sacred pause fr
 om the busyness of everyday life.\n**🙏Donations Start at $33-Please giv
 e more if you can. If $33 is to much\, just email David at [[david@starsou
 nds.love](mailto:david@starsounds.love)]([mailto:david@starsounds.love](ht
 tp://mailto:david@starsounds.love)) for a special price🙏**\n**Register 
 here:** [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-details/cosmic-qui
 etude-astrology-gong-meditation-2)\n\\#\\#\\# 👤 **About David Heiss**\n
 David Heiss is an **Evolutionary Astrologer and Sound Alchemist** devoted 
 to guiding himself and others into deeper self-awareness through vibration
  and cosmic insight.\nSince 2012\, he has worked with the transformative p
 ower of **gongs and astrology**\, following a profound awakening that shif
 ted his life toward a path of healing and inner discovery.\nHis work blend
 s:\n\n* **Astrological intelligence** (understanding your soul’s path)\n
 * **Sound immersion** (direct vibrational experience)\n\nCreating a space 
 where participants can **remember who they are on a deeper level**.\nHis i
 ntention is simple and precise: to help you **experience yourself more ful
 ly**.\n**🧘‍♂️Please bring your own "sound healing nest"** includi
 ng blankets\, pillows\, bolsters\, or any other comforts that will support
  you in resting deeply during the journey. **Yoga mats are provided by Qui
 etude.**\nCome settle into stillness\, attune to the wisdom of the heavens
 \, and allow the medicine of sound to carry you home to yourself.\n*"As ab
 ove\, so within."*
